      "value": "@{62b61f8ec938a62475e4cd14|full_name}There was a client update today, so I tested it again just to be sure.\n\nI understand that the update notes did not mention anything related to this issue, but I wanted to report that the problem still persists after the update.\n\nI have attached the latest logs and crash dump to support ticket #730806. Please feel free to use them for further investigation.",
